    "text": "By Lizz Daniels ,\n11 hours ago Just down the road from Seguin, one of Texas’ largest anime conventions will be taking place this weekend. San Japan kicks off Friday, September 4, and runs through Sunday the 6 in downtown San Antonio. Convention organizers guarantee a good time, with this being the con’s seventeenth year in action. Read full article",
